	(text "K-type thermocouple on J20 (DEGSON DG127H-5.08-02P screw terminal). Differential RC filter (R220/R221 1k, C220 100n diff, C221/C222 10n CM):\nfc(diff) = 1/(2*pi*2k*100n) = 0.8 kHz, fc(CM) = 16 kHz. R222/R223 10M (terminal side of R220/R221, so their bias current does not flow through the 1k) pull the inputs to the rails when the\nthermocouple is open (ADS1115 reads full scale -> firmware reports NAN). D220/D221 PESD5V0S1BA clamp ESD/EFT from the probe wiring.\nADS1115: AIN0-AIN1 differential, PGA +/-256 mV (7.8 uV/LSB = 0.19 C for K), 16 SPS; ADDR=GND -> 0x48; ALERT/RDY -> ADC_RDY (IO35).\nCold junction: TH220 10k NTC (Murata NCP18XH103, B=3380 K) placed touching J20; ratiometric against R226/R227 half-supply on AIN3.\nLayout: route TC_P/TC_N as a tightly coupled pair, keep away from the triac/heater wiring and the LCD bus; single-point ground at U20."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c54c75a0-bef7-4ae8-b047-f9cefc7d8ecd")
	)
